under its terms. Converting a rules-based framework into annually-exercised bilateral leverage is a structural change whatever the framing, and it lands alongside live cartel-designation pressure. Whether it is 'routine' depends entirely on what replaces it, which is undefined.","status":"CONTESTED-BY-STAKES"}]},"offmap":true,"history":{"roots":"The global-economy theater tracks the system's regime change: from one integrated market toward blocs. Three shocks stacked — the pandemic, the Ukraine war, and the tariff wars — breaking the assumptions of frictionless trade. Weaponized interdependence became doctrine: export controls on chips, rare-earth counter-controls, sanctions architectures, friend-shoring. The 2026 Hormuz crisis added the energy-chokepoint shock; US tariff statecraft rewired supply chains by decree; and the AI capex boom became the growth engine and the bubble question simultaneously. The platform reads it all through one lens: interdependence is no longer a stabilizer — it's the arsenal.","timeline":[{"date":"2008","e":"Financial crisis — the last system-wide rescue consensus."},{"date":"2018","e":"US-China tariff war begins the decoupling era."},{"date":"2020-22","e":"Pandemic + Ukraine war break the supply-chain assumptions."},{"date":"2022-","e":"Chip controls vs rare-earth controls — weaponized interdependence formalized."},{"date":"2025-26","e":"Universal tariff regime; Hormuz energy shock; AI capex boom carries growth; gold at records as the hedge."}],"actors":[{"name":"The US (tariff statecraft)","bio":"The system's author now its re-writer — access to the American market as the universal lever."},{"name":"China (the counter-arsenal)","bio":"Rare earths, refining chokeholds, and the export-control mirror — decoupling managed, not suffered."},{"name":"Central banks + gold","bio":"The de-dollarization hedge made visible — record central-bank gold buying as the system's trust gauge."},{"name":"The AI capex complex","bio":"The growth engine and the bubble question — data centers as the decade's infrastructure race."}],"bridge":"Farrell and Newman named the platform's operating premise: networks built for efficiency became instruments of coercion — the dollar clearing system, the chip chain, the rare-earth chokehold — and the 2026 economy is their thesis at full deployment: tariff statecraft, export-control duels, an energy chokepoint war, and gold's record run as the exit hedge. Rodrik's trilemma supplies the constraint: deep integration, national sovereignty, and democratic politics cannot all be maximized — and every bloc is now choosing which to sacrifice. The platform reads prices as politics because, in this regime, they are.","sources":[{"work":"Underground Empire: How America Weaponized the World Economy","author":"Henry Farrell & Abraham Newman","year":"2023","note":"The weaponized-interdependence thesis — this platform's economic lens, formalized."},{"work":"The Globalization Paradox","author":"Dani Rodrik","year":"2011","note":"The trilemma constraining every bloc's choices."},{"work":"Central-bank gold purchase series","author":"World Gold Council / IMF COFER","year":"2022-26","note":"Primary data behind the de-dollarization gauge."}]},"refs":[{"t":"PBS NewsHour (30 Jul 2026)","u":"https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/july-30-2026-pbs-news-hour-full-episode"},{"t":"NPR · world (31 Jul 2026)","u":"https://www.npr.org/sections/world/"},{"t":"African Business · Africa's finance ministers push for a rewrite of the rules (Apr 2026)","u":"https://african.business/2026/04/innov-africa-deals/africas-finance-ministers-push-for-a-rewrite-of-the-rules-in-washington"},{"t":"UNDP · Navigating the Debt Crisis working paper","u":"https://www.undp.org/sites/g/files/zskgke326/files/2025-08/undp-working_paper_series-navigating_the_debt_crisis_7_aug_2025.pdf"},{"t":"Atlantic Council · Africa enters 2026 facing a debt crisis","u":"https://www.atlanticcouncil.org/blogs/econographics/africa-enters-2026-facing-a-debt-cris