oits real 4th-term + AES-sympathy grievances"}, {"theater": "balkans", "role": "Target", "detail": "Russian hybrid information operations backing Serbian non-recognition of Kosovo and Republika Srpska secession"}, {"theater": "sudan", "role": "Atrocity laundering", "detail": "RSF/UAE narrative management around the genocide determination; the HRC motion still declines to name the UAE"}, {"theater": "us-politics", "role": "Contested space", "detail": "The information environment itself as a domain of great-power competition"}, {"theater": "mali", "role": "Vector", "detail": "Russia/Africa Corps narrative operations supporting the juntas and framing France as the enemy — the template the Ivorian campaigns imitate"}, {"theater": "burkina", "role": "Vector", "detail": "Junta-aligned messaging; the AES model whose appeal the coup-disinformation campaigns are engineered to spread"}]}];
